  "summary": "Fixes a unit test in miner_tests by setting the prevout index to 0 for a test transaction in TestBasicMining. Previously, the test reused a transaction whose prevout was reset with SetNull(), leaving the output index as NULL_INDEX. This change ensures the first transaction spends a valid output so the test properly validates failure due to a double spend rather than a nonexistent input.",
